          "name": "Create a voice blender job",
          "request": {
            "name": "Create a voice blender job",
            "description": {
              "content": "Creates a voice blender job and adds it to the blender queue. Provide two to four voice models and one fewer alpha value than the number of models (the last alpha is 1 minus the sum of the others). The output model is usable once the job status is \"success\".",
